    Mastra is offered as an OPTIONAL npm peer
    (`optionalDependencies["@mastra/core"]`) — nothing from it is copied into
    this repository, so the vendored tree stays unambiguously MIT.
  * openclaw (github.com/openclaw/openclaw) — 389k stars, TypeScript, but its
